From 13d4a7d0efe33256755149fa366072692152f84f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 15:25:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD backend slash-command dispatch to keep selected-agent
 commands off prompt sends

Selected-agent slash chat messages execute through the backend command hook so native commands such as /status and /fork stay on the active provider session instead of being submitted as ordinary prompts.
---
 docs/architecture.md  | 14 +++++++-----
 src/agent_runtime.rs  | 12 ++++++++++
 src/cli.rs            | 24 ++++++++++++++++++++
 src/codex.rs          | 33 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/workspace.rs      | 44 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 tests/terminal_app.rs | 37 ++++++++++++++++++++++++------
 tests/workspace.rs    | 52 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----------
 7 files changed, 190 insertions(+), 26 deletions(-)

